# proto-message: nexteggapp.taxprotos.common.v1.FormMapping
#
# What Form CT-1040 calls each concept, per tax year.
#
# Lines come from the 2025 Form CT-1040 (Rev. 12/25) as the Connecticut
# Department of Revenue Services publishes it. There are no amount codes: IRS
# Publication 1220 covers the information returns the IRS receives
# electronically, and a state return is not one of them.
#
# Line 17 repeats line 16 and is not mapped separately.

